<!-- tf-pr-commenter:detail -->
<details><summary>📋 <code><%= it.stack.name %></code><% if (it.stack.countsLine) { %> <code><%= it.stack.countsLine %></code><% } %><% if (it.stack.driftCount) { %> ⚠️ <%= it.stack.driftCount %> drifted<% } %><% if (it.stack.outputsCount) { %> Δ <%= it.stack.outputsCount %> outputs<% } %></summary>

<% if (it.stack.actionsText) { %>```diff
<%~ it.stack.actionsText + '\n' %>
```

<% } %><% if (it.stack.driftText) { %>**⚠️ Changed outside Terraform:**

```diff
<%~ it.stack.driftText + '\n' %>
```

<% } %><% if (it.stack.outputsText) { %>**Δ Output changes:**

```diff
<%~ it.stack.outputsText + '\n' %>
```

<% } %></details>
<!-- tf-pr-commenter:shell -->
<%/*
Eta's default autoTrim ('nl') removes one newline after each closing tag.
Keep two blank lines after the H2 line below so one survives before the table.
*/%>
<% if (it.stacks.length === 0) { %>
## <%= it.header %>

✅ No stacks with changes to plan.<% } else { %>
## <%= it.header %> — <%= it.totalCount %> stack<%= it.totalCount === 1 ? '' : 's' %>


| Stack | Plan | Status |
|---|---|---|
<% it.stacks.forEach((stack) => { %>| <%~ stack.nameCell %> | <%~ stack.planCell %> | <%= stack.statusIcon %><% if (stack.driftCount) { %> ⚠️ <%= stack.driftCount %> drifted<% } %><% if (stack.outputsCount) { %> Δ <%= stack.outputsCount %> outputs<% } %> |
<% }) %><% if (it.detailSections.length) { %>

<%~ it.detailSections.join('\n\n') %>
<% } %><% if (it.omittedCount > 0) { %>

> ⚠️ Plan detail for <%= it.omittedCount %> stack<%= it.omittedCount === 1 ? '' : 's' %> omitted to fit the comment size limit — see each job's step summary. Counts above are complete.
<% } %><% } %><% if (it.unchangedCount > 0) { %>


> ⚪ <%= it.unchangedCount %> stack<%= it.unchangedCount === 1 ? '' : 's' %> unchanged — no planned changes and no drift.
<% } %>
